# ---- Per-user assistant tooling (keep secrets/tokens out of the repo) ----
# Copilot/SonarQube-MCP instructions are auto-generated per machine; the matching
# MCP config can hold a SonarCloud token, so never let these get committed.
# NB: .github/workflows/ stays tracked (that's CI) — only /instructions/ is ignored.
.github/instructions/
# Claude Code MCP server config (holds a ${SONARQUBE_TOKEN} env reference; per-user).
.mcp.json

# ---- Logs ----
*.log
logs/
